OL,3,APhotos show potholes days before fatal
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewly released photographs show a road
OL,7,Friddled with potholes just days before
OL,8,Fa speeding car struck one and plunged
OL,9,Finto a river, killing two teenagers.
OL,11,FA VW Polo driven by Declan Berry was
OL,12,Ftravelling at about 90mph (145km/h)
OL,13,Fmoments before it entered the River
OL,14,FNene on North Brink, near Wisbech,
OL,15,FCambridgeshire, on 17 March, killing
OL,16,Fhim and one of his passengers.
OL,18,FFour days earlier, Cambridgeshire
OL,19,FCounty Council had ordered repairs to
OL,20,F98 potholes along the road, with the
OL,21,Fwork scheduled to start on 3 April.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
