OL,3,APhotos show potholes days before fatal
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said repairs to that
OL,7,Fsection of North Brink had been
OL,8,F"scheduled in line with our normal
OL,9,Fmaintenance processes and response
OL,10,Ftimes".
